# Frontend Rules

- TypeScript only — no `.js`/`.jsx` source files
- Tailwind CSS utility classes only — no CSS modules or per-component stylesheets
- Vite builds to `rfq-intake/build/` as `rfq-form.js` + `rfq-form.css`
- Mount under `#rfq-form-root`
- Use MSW in Vitest for API mocking (M4+)

Do not start frontend work until REST `POST /sessions` and `GET /health` exist (IMPLEMENTATION.md).
